WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:09.122
This video shows how to draw an icon in Pixodesk SVG Editor, from a few simple shapes, and use it on a web page as an ordinary image.

2
00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:13.319
Let's start with the background, a square tile.

3
00:00:16.733 --> 00:00:19.528
A rectangle, nearly as big as the canvas.

4
00:00:20.767 --> 00:00:24.267
Icons look friendlier with soft corners, so let's round them.

5
00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:31.149
One corner radius rounds all four corners.

6
00:00:32.367 --> 00:00:34.561
Then, let's paint it sky blue.

7
00:00:36.867 --> 00:00:39.270
Its fill colour is now sky blue.

8
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:44.183
Next, the sun, an orange circle in the top corner.

9
00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:53.035
Holding Shift while drawing keeps it a perfect circle.

10
00:00:54.267 --> 00:01:00.771
The cloud is built from simple shapes. Three white circles, and a rectangle for a flat bottom.

11
00:01:09.133 --> 00:01:12.581
Four overlapping shapes, in the outline of a cloud.

12
00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:17.065
Let's select all four, and unite them into one shape.

13
00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:24.644
Unite merges them into a single path, the cloud.

14
00:01:25.867 --> 00:01:27.930
A soft gradient gives it some depth.

15
00:01:33.233 --> 00:01:36.420
A linear gradient, from white to light blue.

16
00:01:37.667 --> 00:01:43.100
The icon is ready. Let's save it as SVG, into the web project.

17
00:01:48.233 --> 00:01:50.428
Now, the page itself.

18
00:01:51.967 --> 00:01:55.859
A heading, and the icon file, already next to the page.

19
00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:00.000
Let's add the icon as an ordinary image.

20
00:02:07.033 --> 00:02:12.885
An image tag, pointing at the SVG file. A still icon needs nothing more.

21
00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:15.466
Let's open the page.

22
00:02:19.600 --> 00:02:24.354
There it is. It stays sharp at any size, because it is vector.

23
00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:33.897
So, a few simple shapes, united and coloured, saved as a clean SVG file, and used like any other image.
